--- Added in v0.2.0 (PhotoMaker v1 identity-preserving edit) ---

PhotoMaker v1 (ID encoder + UNet LoRA), loaded at runtime from converted weights of
  https://huggingface.co/TencentARC/PhotoMaker  (photomaker-v1.bin)
  License: Apache-2.0 (code); the ID encoder is a CLIP ViT-L/14 (OpenAI CLIP). No InsightFace.

