  https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0
  License: CreativeML OpenRAIL++-M (commercial use permitted with use-based restrictions).

Optional 3D-render style preset (independent, swappable LoRA — NOT hardcoded):
  https://huggingface.co/goofyai/3d_render_style_xl
  License: Apache-2.0. Generic "3D render" style (not a studio-branded style). Trigger: "3d render".

Compact LoRA folding is performed natively in Swift at load time; no Python/diffusers is required at runtime.
Weights are read from a caller-staged local HubApi layout; this package does not redistribute them.
